[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3001633077","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107950#issuecomment-3001633077","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107950","id":3001633077,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6y6Uk1","user":{"login":"LUNART231","id":164064359,"node_id":"U_kgDOCcdsZw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164064359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LUNART231","html_url":"https://github.com/LUNART231","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LUNART231/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LUNART231/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LUNART231/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LUNART231/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LUNART231/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LUNART231/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LUNART231/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LUNART231/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LUNART231/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T19:32:06Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T19:32:06Z","body":"calling deferred the free function, fix the problem.\nif anyone needs to fix the problem quickly with an incomplete solution.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3001633077/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3015004062","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107950#issuecomment-3015004062","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107950","id":3015004062,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ztU-e","user":{"login":"BrotherShort","id":129957860,"node_id":"U_kgDOB77_5A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129957860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort","html_url":"https://github.com/BrotherShort","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrotherShort/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-28T05:58:39Z","updated_at":"2025-06-28T06:01:59Z","body":"I debuged it. Looks like a thread safety issue. After you click, A thread is executing `select_single_item` function, and another thread is executing `memdelete`. The `select_single_item` will call the treeitem's cells. At that moment, the treeitem has no cells, So crash.\n\nAs game developers, we can use `remove_child` function in front of `free` function to fix the problem.\nAs Godot engine developers, we can use error macro to fix the problem quickly.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3015004062/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3024758900","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107950#issuecomment-3024758900","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107950","id":3024758900,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60Sih0","user":{"login":"bs-mwoerner","id":35597337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk3MzM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35597337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner","html_url":"https://github.com/bs-mwoerner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-01T16:35:23Z","updated_at":"2025-07-01T16:35:23Z","body":"The `item_selected` signal is emitted while the `Tree` walks its children to update their selection status. If you `free()` an item during this enumeration, the tree does not know that its current pointer now points to invalid memory and will continue to operate on the freed item. This leads to undefined behavior and crashing the engine is a likely outcome.\n\nAs a general rule, randomly freeing scene tree nodes in the middle of a frame and especially during a signal handler can be expected to cause crashes. Do not `free()` objects that other code may currently be working with. In a majority of cases, calling `free()` is incorrect usage and `queue_free()` should be used instead.\n\nAs for why this example sometimes crashes and sometimes doesn't: The tree iterates the `TreeItem`s via their `next` pointer. If you free an item, there is a certain probability that the corresponding memory location still holds the last value, i. e. the last next pointer before deletion. If this memory location contains all zeros when the tree reads it, the tree may end the iteration before accessing the freed item again and thus not crash. This can happen if the freed item was the last item (and did not have a next item) or if it was removed explicitly via `remove_child`. It isn't guaranteed, though, since the memory may have been overwritten in the meantime.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3024758900/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3294074643","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107950#issuecomment-3294074643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107950","id":3294074643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EV5cT","user":{"login":"NogginBops","id":3778357,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzgzNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3778357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops","html_url":"https://github.com/NogginBops","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T21:49:43Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T21:49:43Z","body":"Maybe the documentation for 4.4 should add a note regarding this bug, as currently it says `free()` should be all that is needed.\n\nTo create a TreeItem, use [Tree.create_item()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/classes/class_tree.html#class-tree-method-create-item) or [create_child()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/classes/class_treeitem.html#class-treeitem-method-create-child). To remove a TreeItem, use [Object.free()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/classes/class_object.html#class-object-method-free).\n\nFrom: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/classes/class_treeitem.html","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3294074643/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3294079139","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107950#issuecomment-3294079139","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107950","id":3294079139,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EV6ij","user":{"login":"NogginBops","id":3778357,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzgzNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3778357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops","html_url":"https://github.com/NogginBops","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T21:52:05Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T21:52:05Z","body":"Another important fact about this bug is that it gives game developers no actionable diagnostic for what went wrong. It just crashes the game, without any message in the godot editor which is not great UX.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3294079139/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313825575","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107950#issuecomment-3313825575","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107950","id":3313825575,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FhPcn","user":{"login":"firefly2442","id":531175,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTE3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/531175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/firefly2442","html_url":"https://github.com/firefly2442","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firefly2442/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firefly2442/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firefly2442/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firefly2442/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firefly2442/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firefly2442/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firefly2442/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firefly2442/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firefly2442/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T21:14:24Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T18:50:51Z","body":"I was able to replicate this error in Godot `4.5` and `4.6.1` stable.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313825575/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]